{"version":"0.1.20261117","status_code":20000,"status_message":"Ok.","time":"4.6068 sec.","cost":0.027135,"tasks_count":1,"tasks_error":0,"tasks":[{"id":"11250944-1289-0612-0000-b7bd3dd35ae9","status_code":20000,"status_message":"Ok.","time":"4.5754 sec.","cost":0.027135,"result_count":1,"path":["v3","ai_optimization","chat_gpt","llm_responses","live"],"data":{"api":"ai_optimization","function":"llm_responses","se":"chat_gpt","user_prompt":"今年のNISA制度の変更点を教えてください","model_name":"gpt-4o-mini","web_search":true},"result":[{"model_name":"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18","input_tokens":8174,"output_tokens":515,"reasoning_tokens":0,"web_search":true,"money_spent":0.0265351,"datetime":"2026-11-25 09:44:24 +00:00","items":[{"type":"message","sections":[{"type":"text","text":"2024年1月から、NISA制度は大幅に改正され、以下の主要な変更点が導入されました。\n\n1. **制度の恒久化と非課税保有期間の無期限化**:\n   - NISA制度は恒久化され、口座開設期間に制限がなくなりました。\n   - 非課税保有期間も無期限となり、長期的な資産形成が可能になりました。 ([jafp.or.jp](https:\/\/jafp.or.jp\/know\/info\/column\/20230609.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **年間投資枠の拡大と併用可能性**:\n   - 「つみたて投資枠」と「成長投資枠」の2つの投資枠が設けられ、両者を併用することが可能となりました。\n   - 年間投資枠は、つみたて投資枠が120万円、成長投資枠が240万円で、合わせて最大360万円まで投資できます。 ([finance.yahoo.co.jp](https:\/\/finance.yahoo.co.jp\/nisa\/article\/detail\/004\/?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **非課税保有限度額の設定**:\n   - 生涯非課税保有限度額が1,800万円（うち成長投資枠は1,200万円）に設定され、長期的な非課税投資が可能となりました。 ([yamada-partners.jp](https:\/\/www.yamada-partners.jp\/reform\/r05\/i01-fundamental-expansion-and-permanentization-of-nisa?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **ジュニアNISAの廃止**:\n   - ジュニアNISAは2023年末で制度が終了し、2024年以降は新たな非課税制度の対象外となりました。 ([fsa.go.jp](https:\/\/www.fsa.go.jp\/policy\/nisa2\/till2023\/index.html?utm_source=openai))\n\nこれらの改正により、より柔軟で長期的な資産形成が可能となり、個人投資家にとって利用しやすい制度へと進化しました。 ","annotations":[{"title":"2023年度税制改正のポイント～NISA制度・相続税・贈与税～ | 日本FP協会","url":"https:\/\/jafp.or.jp\/know\/info\/column\/20230609.shtml?utm_source=openai","start_index":149,"end_index":233,"text":"([jafp.or.jp](https:\/\/jafp.or.jp\/know\/info\/column\/20230609.shtml?utm_source=openai))"},{"title":"NISAとは？　2024年と2026年の変更点をお金のプロが解説 - Yahoo!ファイナンス","url":"https:\/\/finance.yahoo.co.jp\/nisa\/article\/detail\/004\/?utm_source=openai","start_index":373,"end_index":468,"text":"([finance.yahoo.co.jp](https:\/\/finance.yahoo.co.jp\/nisa\/article\/detail\/004\/?utm_source=openai))"},{"title":"NISAの抜本的拡充・恒久化 | 税理士法人山田&パートナーズ","url":"https:\/\/www.yamada-partners.jp\/reform\/r05\/i01-fundamental-expansion-and-permanentization-of-nisa?utm_source=openai","start_index":556,"end_index":694,"text":"([yamada-partners.jp](https:\/\/www.yamada-partners.jp\/reform\/r05\/i01-fundamental-expansion-and-permanentization-of-nisa?utm_source=openai))"},{"title":"2023年までのNISA：NISA特設ウェブサイト：金融庁","url":"https:\/\/www.fsa.go.jp\/policy\/nisa2\/till2023\/index.html?utm_source=openai","start_index":772,"end_index":859,"text":"([fsa.go.jp](https:\/\/www.fsa.go.jp\/policy\/nisa2\/till2023\/index.html?utm_source=openai))"}]}]}],"fan_out_queries":["2023 NISA 制度 変更点"],"search_results":[{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.minatobk.co.jp\/kojin\/nisa\/old_nisa.html?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/jafp.or.jp\/know\/info\/column\/20230609.shtml?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.fsa.go.jp\/policy\/nisa2\/till2023\/index.html?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.smbcnikko.co.jp\/service\/tax_sys\/kinyu\/2023\/?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/finance.yahoo.co.jp\/nisa\/article\/detail\/004\/?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.yamada-partners.jp\/reform\/r05\/i01-fundamental-expansion-and-permanentization-of-nisa?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.momijibank.co.jp\/personal\/operating\/tsumitate\/?utm_source=openai","date":null,"snippet":null},{"title":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.jsda.or.jp\/nisa\/before2023\/re